                                "sense_id": "e022d733-f310-38ea-be87-6b0a298f14f5",
                                "text": "[...] we apply thingal subjective conceptions. Our perceptions have a negation in them, they have not Being enough; to know the fact we must study by appropriate means, we must lay aside all these thingal idols of the mind; [...]"
