                                "sense_id": "e022d733-f310-38ea-be87-6b0a298f14f5",
                                "text": "Indeed he possessed no true aesthetic feeling at all; there is probably not a single word in all that he wrote which indicates any sense of what he would probably call \"thingal beauty\"."
